// IntroString :
"P3913202525" "Something has come up which we can use to our advantage. You know how you took down the Lost leader in the sewers? Well, the other Lost in the area retaliated by attacking a Longbow base and capturing Captain Yushenko herself! This is a great opportunity to gain Yushenko's trust! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Interrogate the Lost to find out where they've taken Captain Yushenko, then rescue her.</A><br><br>"
// AcceptString :
"P1825292272" "Find and rescue Captain Yushenko"
// SendOffString :
"P4276610286" "Yushenko was in pretty rough shape when they took her, so she's not likely to be of much help."

