// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1580880672" "Your theft and field-testing of the Nullifier Gun was successful. The word is that Longbow is panicking about having the device fall into the wrong hands! Yushenko is trying to settle things down, but Longbow internal security is breathing down her neck.<br><br>It is time for you and I to profit! I've managed to acquire the newly constructed Nullifier Gun Mk. I - a more effective version of the prototype you tested. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Take the Nullifier Gun to an Arachnos Operative in Sharkhead.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1190873547" "Deliver Nullifier Gun to Arachnos"
// SendOffString :
"P3924835848" "Yushenko is going to be upset about the loss of the device, but she'll have to deal with it.<br><br>Oh, and watch out for Longbow forces. They've targeted you as the culprit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1914345088" "<shout>Halt, {VillainName}! The device you possess is property of Longbow!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1941601229" "<shout>We won't let you get away with the Nullifier Gun, {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3041735161" "Lieutenant Demitrovich has given you the Nullifer Gun Mk. I."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2022390992" "Ah, yes! I've been expecting you, {VillainName}! This must be the Nullifier Gun you and Lieutenant Demitrovich managed to acquire from those fools at Longbow. Let me do a quick analysis of its components - ah, yes, very interesting!  We have everything we need to create a new Nullifier Gun. You may keep the Mk. I version for yourself!<br><br>Excellent work, {VillainName}! Arachnos approves of your efforts!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P473146367" "Excellent work. Arachnos is quite pleased by the Nullifier Gun."
// RandomFameString :
"P4285987362" "I heard that {VillainName} tricked Longbow out of some sweet tech!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P3394233057" "Longbow is really irate after {VillainName} stole one of their newest weapon designs and passed it on to Arachnos!"
